#: scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56dfd97d71b4e59557ea123afdbe20d15bf312fa7a7d68318daf4d41b3edaffb
#. default-sha256: e7ea02eda1f564d89c3ce2b4bd31714fc87ef5aed31a42a282eebef5c58e551a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I received no visitors except the servants—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫and "
"again, none of them would look me in the eye."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Je n’avais aucun visiteur, hormis les serviteurs —⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ "
"et à nouveau, aucun ne daignait croiser mon regard."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b6ff1778f669d9965e6c0a62411d292f53c3f74bdbfd814763cacf82fb0cf2d
#. default-sha256: 1c41ab2099cb9d8297ae08b5027ee69dc6b9f578034276ac8fee107d04129f28
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every day was the same. Day in and day out, day in and day out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tous les jours se ressemblaient. Jour après jour, jour après jour."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bad527fdadbaa9e977998bab49a6462eba326bcb6aba3ba91b64c7cfa115998
#. default-sha256: 2a85bfb9114d11a1d96e60a3b92633af0877717b868a595b7fc82378924dfe5e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was my mother’s handwriting on the parchment.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We lived in the same house, yet "
"she refused to show herself before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était l’écriture de ma mère sur le parchemin.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nous vivions dans la même maison, "
"et pourtant elle refusait de venir me voir en personne."

#: scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3db4520c6aeda51b8c1df1b3c881de17b17e0f2c8c620688c6eef46eb98d1c0a
#. default-sha256: 507221b34c575c824c7ce45f7f964b8852e807d79f992a7fdf8dfeb48e62b5d6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no choice but to respond to her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’avais d’autre choix que de répondre à ses lettres."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad7130b71c7bd703d0151986035c5d3d2c0695233ab00edeea91df6dcc0d4f5e
#. default-sha256: 2904d0143f8ab9a757a7fa5fd9382f9d547828bc7f853b8d950a3bd50853a1ce
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a constant sense of urgency to her letters—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like she might fall apart "
"completely at any second."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il y avait toujours une certaine fébrilité dans ses lettres —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ comme si elle allait "
"craquer à tout instant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f53b2ff76ccc9b936625aa0e20c203f852b8e4dd469faaffde26a72bae0a6a
#. default-sha256: 5b6a24ac59b87f4b47d4f7ce964656b26094a5de9ea282b1164bd626636621ae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On paper, she expressed her concern for me, but that concern only served to cause me more "
"pain,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sur le papier, elle se disait inquiète pour moi, mais cette inquiétude ne faisait que "
"rajouter du sel sur mes plaies,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A353A3A_635A_4947_9D08_BEDE299ED623
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
